mida tasuks uuesti korra kuulata.

110
00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:41.225
Ja siis ta.

111
00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:54.335
Kust abi edasi?

112
00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:59.770
Ilus, mida mulle soo siis?

113
